  `/api/oap/leave/` instead of `/api/v1/oap/leave/`, resulting in HTTP 404 responses.
- As per the course defect classification scheme, this is logged as ISS-OAP-003:
  Test-Generation Problem (the AI model hallucinated route prefixes different from the
  actual Django urls.py router configuration).
